# civil-holidays v1
# jurisdiction: MN
# source: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Public_holidays_in_Mongolia
#   Structure and dates derived from vacanza/holidays 0.101 (MIT)
#   (github.com/vacanza/holidays), an independent open-source reference
#   maintained against each country's official calendar. Primary names are
#   the jurisdiction's own official-language rendering as vacanza publishes
#   it; English lands only in translations.tab, never in this column.
#   Lunar-calendar holidays (Tsagaan Sar, Buddha Day, Chinggis Khaan's
#   birthday) have no closed-form rule modelled here and are captured as
#   'decree' (explicit per-year dates, basis tabulated) for 2024-2025 --
#   silent outside those years rather than fabricated. Multi-day breaks
#   (Tsagaan Sar, Naadam) are split into one row per calendar day, numbered
#   "(1)".."(6)". Naadam's six calendar days are identical in both 2024 and
#   2025 and are therefore modelled as fixed rather than decree.
# retrieved: 2026-07-22
# categories: public|regional|municipal|religious|school
# columns: kind | name | args | categories | subdiv | observed | valid | span
#
